{"v":4,"catch":"在無窮無盡的復古動作中奔跑、跳躍和砍擊！","desc":"Bamboo Retro Run 是一款以竹林為背景的迷人 2D 像素藝術遊戲。玩家必須無止境地奔跑，並面對不斷逼近的怪獸，玩家必須跳到怪獸身上或砍殺怪獸，才能消滅怪獸。遊戲的難度和速度會隨著進度增加，增加挑戰性。本遊戲採用復古風格，玩家使用復古的控制台介面，可見按鈕可模仿遊戲控制。您能走多遠？您能取得的最高分是多少？","publisher":"Zakym","release":"2024-11-28","genres":["街機","格鬥","模擬","訓練"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9856e08d8a949736867a8e2ab1b0168b115e83b2451f3139e5b85b7356682bbd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7afbfa95bc60d39e7b2d723a31ac908c61b329f19d5b216a322bfdf803e4ce07.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae9ad83934f142f9af903b0328cba6010f7862ebe35cb5de0dc0ceeca365aa28.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b497ebe0203179a4f1eadefad693d87ff1fc9a0c9f0c28b98a192568af1ef290.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6a44279ef2c62cee3dffe45e000ff0348ff39af22aef2e22b6dc1c19981888a8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8697187ccff9fe1575962de8a481cd928dea263eee9024babd82cade5bf93ee0.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b52020ba2000","dlc":[]}